          <h4>Handverlesene Aufenthalte in Shibuya</h4>
          <div class="hotel-item">
            <span><strong>Cerulean Tower Tokyu Hotel</strong> — Upscale luxury high above the Shibuya skyline with spacious rooms and serene Japanese gardens.</span>
            <a href="https://www.booking.com/city/jp/tokyo.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hotel-link">Check Rates &rarr;</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hotel-item">
            <span><strong>TRUNK (HOTEL) Yoyogi Park</strong> — Award-winning design boutique hotel overlooking Yoyogi Park with an infinity rooftop pool.</span>
            <a href="https://www.booking.com/city/jp/tokyo.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hotel-link">Check Rates &rarr;</a>
          </div>
